{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/3ec85bb506a72f590d0828ff64471314.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;That night\u2026 did we just clink our glasses?&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were living the life of an ordinary delivery man, and one day you get scammed by your only friend and end up taking over a failing, debt-ridden Pocha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait... but why are there so many pretty girls at this Pocha?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/7021195029c91d3b065e3c170ce10a4e.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story shaped entirely by your choices, '<strong>Love Too Easily 2: Summer Pocha</strong>' is an FMV simulation game where the story unfolds in a Pocha with five attractive girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the owner of a Pocha and win over the affection of the girls you like to find your true love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right choices to raise affection levels, and show your feelings with thoughtful gifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five girls, each with her own charm and personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Pocha part-timer: Choi Sol (Lee Heeru)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/c4bd1dfa90cef3373e9c20f596d42226.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overflowing with cuteness\u2014the bright and bubbly mascot of the Pocha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cGood morning, boss!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pocha regular/writer: Anna (Shin Jiwon/Johyun)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/4ba43af96e57077583e2e79da7daad84.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/4ba43af96e57077583e2e79da7daad84.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/4ba43af96e57077583e2e79da7daad84.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional and elegant\u2026 yet secretly a goofy heavy drinker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cCan you be the main character of my story?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming first love classmate: Sarang (Yang Seul)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/8a5b86742c404d0ca1f51861d3ad952a.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/8a5b86742c404d0ca1f51861d3ad952a.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/8a5b86742c404d0ca1f51861d3ad952a.mp4?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first love with its secret innocence..!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cHow.. have you been? Finally, we meet again..\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Famous streamer: Gain (Oh Yeonha)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/31c37459702808bbaa29985d13de3732.poster.avif?t=1764745515\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915220/extras/31c37459702808bbaa29985d13de3732.webm?t=1764745515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh